  "description": {
   "en": "Barely scraping by as a part-time delivery driver, Taeha suddenly hits the jackpot when he wins the lottery. But on his way home, he gets involved in a motorcycle accident and blacks out. When he wakes up, he finds himself back in his high school days 10 years ago. What’s crazier is that he realizes he’s stuck in a weird dating sim!\n\n“Find the capture targets and raise their affection levels!”\n\nCan Taeha charm his way through the game and return to the real world?"
  },
